Usage of init:
  -effort string
    	managed reasoning effort; inherits matching launcher preferences
  -managed
    	create a managed plan with an explicit local CLI profile
  -out string
    	new plan file (default "irrigator.json")
  -preferences string
    	execution preference JSON; otherwise IRRIGATOR_EXECUTION_PREFERENCES
  -profile string
    	managed profile selector; omitted uses explicit launcher/default preferences
